<title>USA: Lucent Technologies Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Lucent Technologies Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.02</p>
<p> Net			255,000		   13,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,918,000		4,744,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 shares are on a pro forma basis, as Lucent was spun off by AT&amp;T less than a year ago.</p>
<p>Total restructuring charges for the quarter ending December 31, 1995, reduced net income by $1,847 million.</p>
</text>
